P.description2:
Standing by the nearest {{tip|sight|visible}} allied or neutral non-champion non-structure unit while not disguised will gather its ''Sho'Ma'' over 2 seconds, adding its disguise to the collection. Activating this disguise places ''Inherent Glamour'' on a 1-second cooldown. '''Neeko''' can collect only one ''Sho'Ma'', but can discard or consume it using her ''Disguise Menu''. She can store ''Sho'Ma'' from the following units, as long as they are targetable:
{{column|2|
* Non-epic {{tip|monsters}}
* {{tip|Minions}}
* {{tip|Stealthed trap|Traps}}
* {{tip|Wards}}
* {{tip|Pets}}
* [[Jungle plants]]
}}

P.description3:
While disguised, '''Neeko''' can use {{tip|basic attacks}} while keeping her form. Her disguise breaks if she:
{{column|2|
* {{tt|uses a damaging {{tip|ability}}, [[summoner spell]], or [[active ability items|item active]]|See notes}}
* becomes {{tip|immobilize|immobilized}}
* takes damage lethal to the disguise's form
* enters the enemy team's [[spawn]] platform{{tt|*|or attempts to disguise while already on the platform}}
* begins a {{tip|channel}} other than {{si|Recall}} / {{si|Empowered Recall}}
* deals damage to a {{tip|structure}} with a non-champion disguise form
* takes damage from a {{tip|turret}}
* {{tip|death|dies}}
}}
